  "title": "IRIS actual I2C1 pullups - supplied charging scenario",
  "source": ".title IRIS actual I2C1 pullups - supplied charging scenario\n* Board-derived topology/nominal R values: Eugene109/IRIS, GPL-3.0-only.\n* https://github.com/Eugene109/IRIS/tree/999dd2eb725d550889c1ffe2c09f8de0390d081b\n* Adaptation: actual R11/R12 nets + supplied100pF busC and ideal step source.\n* Not a full IO/firmware/digital SI model; upstream EasyEDA conversion warnings remain.\nVPULLUP rail 0 PWL(0 0 1u 0 1.001u 3.3 4u 3.3)\nR11 rail I2C1_SDA 2.2k\nR12 rail I2C1_SCLK 2.2k\nCASSUMED_SDA I2C1_SDA 0 100p\nCASSUMED_SCLK I2C1_SCLK 0 100p\n.tran 1n 4u\n.end\n",
